  <text id="title" x="58" y="40" width="980" height="46" font="heading" size="30" color="ink" wrap="false">Lagos decisions are parcel-driven and corridor-sensitive</text>
  <text id="subtitle" x="58" y="86" width="1096" height="30" font="body" size="16" color="muted">The platform now includes a true browser-rendered web map that brings parcel markers, overlay corridors, and workflow context into one review space for Lagos land administration.</text>
